      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "4 + 5 = 5 + 4",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "4 + (5 + 6) = (4 + 5) + 6",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "4 + 0 = 4",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "2(3 + 4) = 2·3 + 2·4",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "derived",
      "explanation": "যোগের সহযোগ বিধি (সংযোজন বিধি): \\(a + (b + c) = (a + b) + c\\)। তাই \\(4 + (5 + 6) = (4 + 5) + 6\\)। (ক) বিনিময় বিধি, (গ) যোগাত্মক অভেদক, (ঘ) বণ্টন বিধি।",
