    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch1-mcq-002",
      "text": "\\(|3 - 2x| \\le 1\\) অসমতাটির সমাধান কোনটি?",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "2 ≤ x ≤ 1",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "1 ≤ x ≤ 2",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "x ≤ 1 অথবা x ≥ 2",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "1 < x ≤ 2",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "derived",
      "explanation": "\\(|3-2x| \\le 1 \\Rightarrow -1 \\le 3-2x \\le 1\\)\n\\(\\Rightarrow -4 \\le -2x \\le -2 \\Rightarrow 1 \\le x \\le 2\\)।",
      "source": {
        "board": "ALL",
        "year": "2026",
        "qno": 4,
        "session": null
      },
      "tags": [],
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "higher_math_2nd-ch1-mcq-003",
      "text": "S = {x ∈ ℝ ; −2 ≤ 3 − x ≤ 8} হলে—",
      "text_en": null,
      "image": null,
      "statements": [
        {
          "label": "i",
          "text": "S = {x ∈ ℝ ; x ∈ [−5, 5]}"
        },
        {
          "label": "ii",
          "text": "\\(|x| \\ge 5\\)"
        },
        {
          "label": "iii",
          "text": "Sup(S) = 5"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "a",
          "text": "i ও ii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "b",
          "text": "i ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "c",
          "text": "ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        },
        {
          "label": "d",
          "text": "i, ii ও iii",
          "image": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": "b",
      "answer_source": "derived",
      "explanation": "\\(-2 \\le 3-x \\le 8 \\Rightarrow -5 \\le x \\le 5\\)\n(i) সত্য: \\(S = [-5, 5]\\)।\n(ii) মিথ্যা: \\(S\\) এর সকল \\(x\\) এর জন্য \\(|x| \\le 5\\)।\n(iii) সত্য: \\(S\\) এর ঊর্ধ্বসীমা \\(5\\), সুতরাং \\(\\text{Sup}(S) = 5\\)।",
